 "Hansard 26th November, 2025", "date_iso": "2025-11-26", "source_url": "https://www.parliament.gh/epanel/docs/pb/26th November, 2025.pdf", "sha256_pdf": "c3550d590f1c02ab826a61b42b1d6edd4304390ef5191d6da111396f6ee04ddf", "pdf_path": "data/corpus/clean/pdfs/2025-11-26 - Hansard 26th November 2025.pdf"}}, {"rank": 5, "chunk_id": "cf93540b99f030653c1d9313ea5f0ed59f3260439bd575a5a3bea87a3e71a4aa:1", "distance": 0.8845685720443726, "metadata": {"date_iso": "2023-12-19", "sha256_pdf": "cf93540b99f030653c1d9313ea5f0ed59f3260439bd575a5a3bea87a3e71a4aa", "chunk_index": 1, "doc_id": "Hansard 19th December, 2023", "source_url": "https://www.parliament.gh/epanel/docs/pb/19TH DECEMBER 2023.pdf", "title": "Hansard 19th December, 2023", "chunk_len_words": 512, "pdf_path": "data/corpus/clean/pdfs/2023-12-19 - Hansard 19th December 2023.pdf"}}]}, "prev_hash": "ab86ec47475278293e63d2bc131b4479f7bab8d7f4e84a74f50c11a1d247275a", "event_hash": "99f37041c9168f15223852f46900a9eff0b7e83bcfa08ddb1d54bc13907aface"}
{"ts_utc": "2026-05-13T11:35:56.207916Z", "run_id": "20260513_113525_rag_L3_S_D1_c95daa", "seq": 5, "event": "generation.completed", "payload": {"answer": "The specific policies discussed by Parliament regarding education rights and access include:\n\n* Abolishing the Double-Track system in the next two years [cf93540b99f030653c1d9313ea5f0ed59f3260439bd575a5a3bea87a3e71a4aa:1]\n* Providing furniture for schools, as seen during a visit by the Committee on Education to Aburi Girls' Senior High School and Presbyterian Secondary Technical School [c3550d590f1c02ab826a61b42b1d6edd4304390ef5191d6da111396f6ee04ddf:5]\n* Implementing measures to prevent examination malpractices and cancellation of examination papers, especially in BECE and WASSCE [6bb06f94c722eb72d17f591f2cb5cee01bdddaff4f92b177281e8b869b04a7a7:3]\n* Preventing the charging of exams fees in public basic schools [6bb06f94c722eb72d17f591f2cb5cee01bdddaff4f92b177281e8b869b04a7a7:3]\n\nNote that these policies were discussed during parliamentary sessions, but it is unclear if they were approved or implemented.", "answer_sha256": "6a66f227099b7528e509317e3b84a74bd1ca4fa13be03af094b083b83bb787e1"}, "prev_hash": "99f37041c9168f15223852f46900a9eff0b7e83bcfa08ddb1d54bc13907aface", "event_hash": "1a1c6a2641c6fe17b9fe88a4d2169a6db05d00766af932559a1cde8da0157f14"}
